{"id":"3322615e4eea05e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-prime.md","title":"Prime Number","display":"df-prime — Prime Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prime","aliases":["58-df-prime","Prime Number"],"display":"df-prime — Prime Number","depends_on":["[[58-df-natural-number]]","[[58-df-divisibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prime</span><span>Prime Number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime — Prime Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"58-df-natural-number\">58-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_S\\)</span>（兼容调用谓词，其参数和定义式见下文）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mid b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(a,b)\">\\(a\\mid b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(a,b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Div}\">\\(\\operatorname{Div}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility.md\">58-df-divisibility.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N\\land 1\\in p\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N\\land 1\\in p\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For von Neumann naturals, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\in p\">\\(1\\in p\\)</span> is the set-theoretic form of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1&lt;p\">\\(1&lt;p\\)</span>; the divisor condition then excludes every proper divisor.</li>\n<li>Fundamental theorem of arithmetic: every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n &gt; 1\">\\(n &gt; 1\\)</span> factors uniquely as product of primes</li>\n<li>Prime number theorem: density of primes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx 1/\\log x\">\\(\\approx 1/\\log x\\)</span>; Hadamard/de la Vallée Poussin proved</li>\n<li>Bertrand's postulate: for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n &gt; 1\">\\(n &gt; 1\\)</span>, exists prime in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n, 2n)\">\\((n, 2n)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Dirichlet: arithmetic progression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a + nd\">\\(a + nd\\)</span> contains infinitely many primes if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(a,d) = 1\">\\(\\gcd(a,d) = 1\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hardy and Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n<li>Tenenbaum, Introduction to Analytic and Probabilistic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Crandall and Pomerance, Prime Numbers</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility.md","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega$，且对 $a,b\\in\\omega$，$a\\mid b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(a,b)$；$\\operatorname{Div}$ 使用 [[58-df-divisibility.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\mid b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Div}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Div}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathbb N\\land 1\\in p\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"1\\in p","display":false},{"tex":"1<p","display":false},{"tex":"n > 1","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx 1/\\log x","display":false},{"tex":"n > 1","display":false},{"tex":"(n, 2n)","display":false},{"tex":"a + nd","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(a,d) = 1","display":false}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"17723ef24b90eee6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）"},{"id":"f17aee2187c4f0d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）"},{"id":"a840395646191699","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（自然数素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）"},{"id":"04f467ed4d556c2a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)$（see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）"},{"id":"7abdef002bccc371","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p\\in\\omega$ and $\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)$ (prime predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])"},{"id":"01a9b20b9e439456","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"41daa15018596763","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_S$ (prime-number predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])"},{"id":"8006c9bacc56d123","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)$ (prime-number predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])"},{"id":"3e88eaec4442b96a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_S$ (prime predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]])"},{"id":"f249216f43ced95c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3363f2782f9bc6a1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d3551c550ac217a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5edfa66c6abe1ecc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-985","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md|58-df-prime]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["0adc4e3c996ff726","b932045a4446f26a"]}